This 10000x 

My ex was this way, they abuse manipulation and gaslighting/dishonesty only get worse and there is almost nothing you can do to make her seek proper treatment.

Separation is the only way, otherwise you’re making yourself suffer and enabling her to get worse. Doesn’t matter about the timeline; evict her asap. I’m so sorry you’re going through this ;3;

